{"id": "1531894134917562399", "channel_id": "1531894134917562399", "author_id": "557599119401811978", "author_name": "heikwok", "content": "覺醒效果\n回合開始時「巨劍・鯨落」在手中，本回合首次「蝕滅」每偷取 1 點狂氣，使下次「斷界之劍」最終傷害 + 1%，最多疊加 90%。\n\n萬古孤臨（最終法則，12）\n靈知覺醒「亙古歸源」獲得強化，「蝕滅」透過偷取獲得的狂氣、最終傷害加成、最終傷害加成疊加上限提高 50%。\n\n最終法則\n單張蝕滅偷狂是45點\n單張最終傷害加成提升上限是45x1.5=67.5%\n\n忽略掉合成巨劍那一個回合吃不到覺醒加成\n67.5% x2 = 135%\n理論上應該只需要經過兩回合，每回合各打一張「蝕滅」，即可把終傷吃滿\n\n實機巨劍卡面有特效提示有三段變化\n估計是考慮到沒有最終法則的情況需要三段才疊滿終傷設計出來的提示\n\n目前AA巨劍用「蝕滅」也是三段特效變化\n由於面板有怪物意圖增傷，不確定是有內置計算出錯問題，還是純粹特效提示有問題", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T05:20:22.981000+00:00", "thread_id": "1531894134917562399", "edited_timestamp": "2026-07-29T05:25:41.446000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1531894135722606642", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 2572704, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1531894134917562399/1531894135722606642/image.png?ex=6a6adf17&is=6a698d97&hm=288d8f2250223fc8210d1a8a1508ea8e3df819531446669f2392836971e07f7b&"}, {"id": "1531894136385441882", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1252047, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1531894134917562399/1531894136385441882/image.png?ex=6a6adf17&is=6a698d97&hm=3057dadb5bb22069e21ff0479abbc0129f12ad0842d3df5b419c5746e01bee2e&"}, {"id": "1531894136838553762", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 2019858, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1531894134917562399/1531894136838553762/image.png?ex=6a6adf17&is=6a698d97&hm=7978d201090c76ccfdfe353c5e7f6353c3e0a6fb1a0c6cfdd856220b83a786c5&"}, {"id": "1531894137270304788", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 2403208, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1531894134917562399/1531894137270304788/image.png?ex=6a6adf17&is=6a698d97&hm=e2b8f7671dea6bc17f9bf1688461c2ae63f4d9070ee0e52c5f54e9042eb08a4d&"}, {"id": "1531894137778081803", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 2533498, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachment